EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. In order to access services on My ASU, including the status of your application, you must have your ASURITE UserID and password.

Your ASURITE ID is: {!Contact.ASURite_ID__c}

To reset your password:

1. Go to the My ASU login screen at https://my.asu.edu.
2. Enter your ASURITE UserID.
3. Click Forgot ID/Password?
4. Follow the instructions on the screen to reset your password.

If you have further questions regarding your ASURITE UserID, please contact the ASU Help Desk at 855-278-5080.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
